      "message": "fix(import): bound the boundary search's sheet jump; pin a saddle's deviation\n\nPR #1638 review items 4, 5 and 7.\n\n- Item 4: an in-domain answer of truck's search is replaced only when it\n  is more than 1e-3 model units off the point and the second search's\n  answer is at least 10 times nearer. A fold of the surface within that\n  distance never moves a boundary point. Pinned by\n  a_boundary_point_does_not_jump_to_a_fold_of_the_surface_within_the_bound.\n- Item 5: a saddle patch imported through step::parse_with_chord has every\n  vertex on the surface and every edge midpoint and facet centre within\n  the chord promise (new test binary import_step_doubly_curved).\n- Item 7: the wall-clock assert in import_step_thread is removed; the\n  facet bound pins the runaway.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
