      "message": "docs(import): say why a miss of the exact search runs no second search\n\nReview of PR 1638 asked whether `search_parameter` returns on purpose\nbefore the second search when truck finds nothing. It does: truck's\nrobust mesher then calls `search_nearest_parameter`, where the second\nsearch runs. Comment only, no code change.\n\nRefs #1602\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
